  "title": "India-Uzbekistan and India-Africa Strategic Partnerships",
  "summary": "India and Uzbekistan strengthened their bilateral trade, defense, and energy cooperation, with India's growing involvement in the Brics expanding. India and Ethiopia further deepened their strategic partnership, with Jaishankar engaging in key discussions with Ethiopian counterpart.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "India and Uzbekistan reaffirmed their commitment to finalize a Bilateral Investment Treaty and conclude trade negotiations by 2026.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India's growing involvement in the Brics has expanded, with increased collaboration in trade and defense.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Jaishankar and his Ethiopian counterpart engaged in detailed discussions on trade, investment, technology, maritime, security, and culture.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
